{
  "title": { "zh": "塞一个 0", "en": "Slip in a 0" },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "像夹在旗标之间那样一帧一帧送出交来的字节，只是内容里每连着 5 个 1 就多说一个 0。",
    "en": "Send the frames handed to you between flags as before, except that after every five 1s in a row in the content you add a 0."
  },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "<level-ref to=\"1-13\"></level-ref>里，内容本身含有 01111110 时，收的一方会把它当成旗标，一帧被从中间切断。两头于是再约好：内容里每连着 5 个 1，发送方就多说一个 0，收的一方再把它去掉。这叫<wiki-ref to=\"stuffing\"></wiki-ref>。",
        "en": "In <level-ref to=\"1-13\"></level-ref>, content that itself holds 01111110 is taken for a flag and the frame is cut in two. So the ends agree on one more rule: after every five 1s in a row in the content the sender says an extra 0, and the receiver takes it out again. This is <wiki-ref to=\"stuffing\"></wiki-ref>."
      }
    }
  ],
  "hint": [
    { "zh": "旗标原样说出，不做填充；填充只管内容。", "en": "Flags go out as they are, unstuffed; only the content is stuffed." },
    {
      "zh": "多说 0 的那一拍，内容停一拍不走：正在说的那一位留到下一拍。",
      "en": "On the tick of the extra 0 the content stands still: the bit that was due waits a tick."
    },
    {
      "zh": "该不该多说一个 0，要看刚说出去的内容里连着几个 1。",
      "en": "Whether an extra 0 is due depends on how many 1s in a row the content has just put on the wire."
    }
  ],
  "inputs": [
    { "name": "byte", "label": { "zh": "队首", "en": "Next byte" } },
